{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109338","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109338/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109338/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109338/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109338","id":3293665198,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7EUVeu","number":109338,"title":"Setting a Project Setting back to default, if default is false or null, removes that Project Setting","user":{"login":"lucho1","id":11302677,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzAyNjc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11302677?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1","html_url":"https://github.com/lucho1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-08-05T16:17:26Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T13:05:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.4.1 stable, not sure about other versions.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10, Godot 4.4.1 stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nSetting a boolean/nullable Project Setting to its default value (if the default value is false or null, which I assume is almost always?) removes that Project Setting. I currently have this project setting, set to true:\n\n<img width=\"764\" height=\"127\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77403487-59a7-4c5f-adc9-226858f997a1\" />\n\nIf I set the setting back to its default value - false - removes the setting, getting this change:\n\n<img width=\"387\" height=\"32\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56d1cd5b-83bb-4121-b06d-644111672c21\" />\n\nThis also happens if I have the setting at false and I click on the icon to put it back to default. It seems to also happen with values that can be null or so, not sure with what else:\n\n<img width=\"989\" height=\"303\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54f3a1a1-bb5a-4fb6-a2c2-2f94bd65c1cf\" />\n\nI would expect to be able to set a setting back to default, even it being null or false, with it not being removed from the Project Settings.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a setting (only tested with boolean settings or settings that can be null)\n2. Set it to some value and save\n3. Set it back to defaults, being its default value false or null\n4. Check it disappears from `project.godot`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109338/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109338/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}